  "role": "Command skirmisher",
  "summary": "Paired arm lasers, a torso Shortbow and a command console form a mobile centre for the lance. The Warden supports coordinated fire behind heavier machines.",
  "lore": "Warden roots appear in the depot ledger beside moving substations and survey towers. Their second working position and lance display first served crews coordinating a moving work party. Restored communications equipment now helps a commander keep a company together; it exchanges reports and orders, never control of another cockpit. The broad shoulder roof protects a machine built to move with its companions. Alone, a Warden is a fast heavy with less armour than its classification invites an enemy to expect.",
